{
    "key": "photography-music",
    "templateKey": "repobot-photography-music",
    "title": "Music Photographer",
    "description": "A music photographer's portfolio built like a slide show in a dark room: full-page crossfade hero, a full-bleed one-frame-per-viewport reel, sequenced live/festival/studio collections with a lightbox, about, and a booking form — a multi-page site edited in one content file, art-directed in the marquee register (stage-black, white type, film grain).",
    "marketingExampleTitle": "Music photographer portfolio",
    "category": "photography",
    "homePath": "/",
    "previewPath": "/photography-music",
    "homeViewDir": "web/app/src/View/PhotographyMusic",
    "base": "content",
    "clientOnly": true,
    "capabilities": ["IOS", "ANDROID"],
    "isDefault": false,
    "theme": {
        "$comment": "The marquee register's overlay: mode dark opens the site in its native stage-night appearance (the appearance toggle still swaps to the white tour-program variant), and the preset's white-on-black ink rides as the project brand so app-side surfaces wear the same strict monochrome register as the marketing pages instead of the kernel default blue. Brand values match the marquee preset's own light/dark accents — the marketing pages resolve brand over preset accent, so keeping them identical means the overlay re-brands the app without shifting the pages.",
        "mode": "dark",
        "brand": {
            "primary": "#161616",
            "primaryDark": "#f2f2f2"
        }
    },
    "contentContract": {
        "$comment": "The pack's content slots, as data (packs/README.md 'Content contract'). Declares what a composer (agent or tool) must bind for a generated variant of this pack to present as real: slot paths into the typed content module, their kinds, and minimums. Authored alongside the module and guarded by the pack's content tests — the module satisfies the contract; the contract never drifts ahead of it.",
        "module": "web/app/src/View/PhotographyMusic/content.ts",
        "slots": {
            "photographer.name": {
                "kind": "text"
            },
            "photographer.tagline": {
                "kind": "text"
            },
            "photographer.location": {
                "kind": "text"
            },
            "photographer.email": {
                "kind": "text"
            },
            "heroSlides": {
                "kind": "media[]",
                "min": 1
            },
            "reel": {
                "kind": "media[]",
                "min": 4
            },
            "albums": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "title": {
                        "kind": "text"
                    },
                    "eyebrow": {
                        "kind": "text"
                    },
                    "description": {
                        "kind": "text"
                    },
                    "images": {
                        "kind": "media[]",
                        "min": 4
                    }
                }
            },
            "home.headline": {
                "kind": "text"
            },
            "home.subheadline": {
                "kind": "text"
            },
            "home.intro.paragraphs": {
                "kind": "text[]",
                "min": 1
            },
            "about.headline": {
                "kind": "text"
            },
            "about.portrait": {
                "kind": "media"
            },
            "about.paragraphs": {
                "kind": "text[]",
                "min": 2
            },
            "about.testimonials": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 1,
                "item": {
                    "quote": {
                        "kind": "text"
                    },
                    "name": {
                        "kind": "text"
                    },
                    "detail": {
                        "kind": "text"
                    }
                }
            },
            "book.headline": {
                "kind": "text"
            },
            "book.body": {
                "kind": "text"
            }
        }
    },
    "landing": {
        "$comment": "Doc-aware pack pages: routes maps each pack route to the page id its config merges under (web/app/src/View/PhotographyMusic/PhotographyMusicPage.tsx, useSitePageConfig). pages seeds each page's layout skeleton — ids match musicLanding.ts; the platform's structural editor edits these. style must ride the overlay: the compose merge keeps the kernel document's root style otherwise, and applySitePageDocument makes the document preset outrank every page's pinned one. The preset is marquee (the stage-night register: warm near-black, tungsten playbill caps, spotlight wash, pushed grain — the photographs are the only color) — the show itself, deliberately apart from tourbook's field journal and atelier's gallery hush.",
        "style": {
            "preset": "marquee"
        },
        "routes": {
            "/": "home",
            "/work": "work",
            "/about": "about",
            "/book": "book"
        },
        "pages": {
